~ nick_talk
[Nick]: I have so little time, I have so little time…
[Riley]: Hey Nick!
[Nick]: Need to do this and need to do that… I have no time!
[Riley]: Nick?
[Nick]: And she’s coming over for her lunch break soon, and I need to hurry before she goes back to work…
[Riley]: Nick!
[Nick]: Huh, oh hey Riley, sorry I didn’t notice you!
[Nick]: Oh shoot, that’s burning! Can you help me do some cooking?
[Riley]: Yeah, sure. This is probably for August; no wonder he’s so worried.
[Riley]: Here, I'll help you out.
[Nick]: Thank you so much!
[Riley]: It’s fine; I know it’s basically August’s lunch break.
[Riley]: She is clearly very important to you.
[Nick]: Yeah.
[Nick]: Only if she had breaks more often so we could see each other.
[Nick]: Unfortunately, they have her stationed at the very top of the clock tower, so she can’t come down as much.
[August]: Hey sweetie!
[Nick]: A-Ah! She's here! H-Hi!
[Riley]: Dang, he got real shy all of a sudden.
[Riley]: I should leave them alone for a bit.
=> END